# This directory is personal/local by default -- most of it (fun clips) is
# converted from whatever audio you own via sync_pi_audio.py, and songs like the ones this
# project was originally tested against (Ring of Fire, Banana Boat, ...) are
# copyrighted and don't belong in a public repo or a build anyone can
# download. Generate your own from your own media library; only the
# synthesized (not copyrighted) prompts and public-domain audio ship as real
# defaults: the operator message, the answering machine's default greeting,
# the dial-up modem sound (Wikimedia Commons, public domain) and the
# 8675309 spoken message. These are
# also the only files main/CMakeLists.txt builds into the firmware.
*
!.gitignore
